WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:06.439
Welcome to Computer Class. Today you will learn: PowerPoint: Your First Slides.

2
00:00:06.739 --> 00:00:12.828
Make a clear presentation with a title and bullet points. Follow each step on your own computer.

3
00:00:13.817 --> 00:00:17.642
Step one. Open PowerPoint and choose Blank Presentation.

4
00:00:18.650 --> 00:00:23.244
Step two. Click the title box and type your title. Keep it short.

5
00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:31.296
Step three. Click New Slide. Write three short bullet points. Do not write long sentences on a slide.

6
00:00:32.283 --> 00:00:38.712
Step four. Click Insert, then Pictures, and add a photo. A picture helps people remember your idea.

7
00:00:39.717 --> 00:00:44.110
Now it is your turn. Try these tasks on your own computer.

8
00:00:44.410 --> 00:00:46.793
Make 3 slides about your family or hobby.

9
00:00:47.093 --> 00:00:50.184
Use only 3 short bullet points on each slide.

10
00:00:50.484 --> 00:00:52.344
Add one picture to a slide.

11
00:00:52.644 --> 00:00:53.576
Well done!

